{"addedOn":10,"avgRating":["fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o","fa fa-star-o"],"breadcrumbsHtml":"<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117\">OpenEdge Development: ABL Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<a href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/ABL-Syntax-Reference.html\">ABL Syntax Reference</a>\n<span><i class=\"fa fa-angle-right\"></i>\n</span>\n<span class=\"active\">TENANT-ID function</span>\n","class":"manual","created":1470,"dislikeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/dislike/310808","html":"<article class=\"hascomments\" data-page=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/TENANT-ID-function.html\" id=\"bundle:openedge-abl-reference-117/enus/TENANT-ID-function.html\"><main role=\"main\"><article aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\" class=\"dita\" id=\"TENANT-ID-function\" role=\"article\">\n  <h1 class=\"title topictitle1 reference\" id=\"ariaid-title1\">TENANT-ID function</h1>\n  \n  <div class=\"body refbody\">\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TENANT-ID-function__section_N10024_N10021_N10001\">\n      <p class=\"p\">Returns the tenant ID (as an integer) of the\nreal tenant associated with a database connection. </p>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TENANT-ID-function__syntax_GC1B1AN2704890\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d475808e96\">Syntax</h2>\n      \n      <table class=\"table frame-all\" id=\"TENANT-ID-function__idGDP2ZZ2677312\"><caption></caption><colgroup><col style=\"width:100%\" /></colgroup><tbody class=\"tbody\">\n            <tr class=\"row rowsep-0\">\n              <td class=\"entry colsep-1 rowsep-1\">\n                <pre class=\"pre codeblock\"><code>TENANT-ID ( <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">[</strong> <var class=\"keyword varname\">database-name </var> <strong class=\"ph b synmeta\">]</strong> )</code></pre>\n               \n                \n              </td>\n            </tr>\n          </tbody></table>\n      <dl class=\"dl parml\">\n        \n          <dt class=\"dt pt dlterm\">\n            <var class=\"keyword varname\">database-name</var>\n          </dt>\n          <dd class=\"dd pd\">\n            <p class=\"p\">A character expression that evaluates to a logical database\nname or database alias. If the database is not enabled for multi-tenancy,\nthe function returns zero (<code class=\"ph codeph\">0</code>).</p>\n            <p class=\"p\">If no database\nis specified and more than one database is connected, the AVM raises\nan error. If the database name is not a valid name for a connected\ndatabase, the AVM raises an error. </p>\n          </dd>\n        \n      </dl>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TENANT-ID-function__notes_GC1B1AO2704897\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d475808e155\">Notes</h2>\n      \n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n        <li class=\"li\">The\ntenant ID of the default tenant is <code class=\"ph codeph\">0</code>. The tenant\nID of a non-default regular tenant is greater than <code class=\"ph codeph\">0</code> and\nthat of a super tenant is less than <code class=\"ph codeph\">0</code>.</li>\n        <li class=\"li\">For a super-tenant connection identity, this function returns\nthe tenant ID of the super tenant, <strong class=\"ph b\">not</strong> the effective tenant.</li>\n      </ul>\n    </section>\n    <section class=\"section\" id=\"TENANT-ID-function__see-also_GC1B1AP2704907\"><h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\" id=\"d475808e182\">See also</h2>\n      \n      <p class=\"p\">\n        <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SET-EFFECTIVE-TENANT-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SET-EFFECTIVE-TENANT-function.html\">SET-EFFECTIVE-TENANT function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TENANT-NAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TENANT-NAME-function.html\">TENANT-NAME function</a>, <a class=\"xref\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TENANT-NAME-TO-ID-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TENANT-NAME-TO-ID-function.html\">TENANT-NAME-TO-ID function</a></p>\n    </section>\n  </div>\n<nav role=\"navigation\"><div class=\"familylinks\"><div class=\"previouslink\"><strong>Previous topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"SYSTEM-HELP-statement.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/SYSTEM-HELP-statement.html\">SYSTEM-HELP statement</a></div><div class=\"nextlink\"><strong>Next topic:</strong> <a class=\"link\" data-bundleid=\"openedge-abl-reference-117\" data-navpath=\"TENANT-NAME-function.html\" href=\"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TENANT-NAME-function.html\">TENANT-NAME function</a></div></div></nav><nav class=\"related-links\" role=\"navigation\"></nav></article></main></article>\n","isWatched":false,"labelText":"Product; Product > OpenEdge; Product > OpenEdge > Version 11.7; Format; Format > Documentation","likes":0,"likeurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/like/310808","myDocsURL":null,"numOfPageViews":0,"numOfRatingsText":"<span>0 Ratings","revised":1318,"showWatch":false,"topicMeta":[["bookowner","oe11docs"],["bookrights","oe11docs"],["bundle","openedge-abl-reference-117"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge"],["data","OEInformationHub/Product/product_openedge/product_openedge_117"],["data","OEInformationHub/format"],["data","OEInformationHub/format/format_documentation"],["organization","oe11docs"]],"topicTitle":"TENANT-ID function","topicurl":"https://docs-be.progress.com/bundle/openedge-abl-reference-117/page/TENANT-ID-function.html","type":"Manual"}